Body:
I have confirmed it seems to be some issue with Minimax's Anthropic endpoint. 
As a workaround, override the default Minimax provider endpoint with the OpenAI one in `opencode.jsonc` config:

```
{
  "provider": {
    // Minimax
    // Point to OpenAI endpoint instead, to fix caching issues
    "minimax": {
      "options": {
        "baseURL": "https://api.minimax.io/v1",
      },
    },
  },
}
```
